    "sector": "Industrial Design",
    "category": "Home Furniture",
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "dir": "auto",
        "children": [
          "Halv is a freestanding television and bookshelf that shapes the space around it. Designed for open interiors, it brings the television away from the wall, dividing a room while creating space for books, objects, and everyday life on the other side. A sculptural denim Micarta frame and transparent shelving balance material presence with visual openness."
        ]
      },
      { "type": "p", "dir": "auto", "children": [{ "type": "br", "className": "trailing-break" }] },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "dir": "auto",
        "children": [
          "The project grew from a question: how can a single object influence the way we inhabit a room? Six months of research, material exploration, and fabrication led to a full-scale working prototype."
        ]
      }
    ],
